    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Fossil-specimen only: original flattened narrow axis segment carrying coarse-to-fine branched laterals through several orders. Limited teaching thickness, nominal0.16m span, muted gray-green fossil palette and simplified terminal counts are art choices. Primary genus description consulted for basic architecture; original inventory needs-specific-reference status retained. No named figure/specimen replica, unknown complete thallus, high extra stalk, holdfast, roots, reproductive bodies or out-of-plane growth asserted. Cylindrical segment character is expressed with softened limited relief.",
      "zh": "仅化石标本：原创扁平窄轴片段，侧枝以粗细阶差表达数级分枝。有限教学厚度、0.16米名义跨度、柔和灰绿化石色及末枝数量简化为美术设定。已查阅属级原始描述支持基本枝序；保留原始needs-specific-reference状态。不宣称具名图/标本复制，不添加未知完整藻体、额外高茎、固着器、根、生殖体或离面生长。圆柱形分枝节段用柔和有限浮雕厚度表达。"
